= The Revomatics =

{{http://therevomatics.com/uploads/3/2/9/3/3293393/980509.jpg?572}}

'''Years active''': 2009 - Present <<BR>>
'''Location''': Milwaukee, Wisconsin, USA


== Biography ==

Hot on the heels of a new album and busy summer tour, The Revomatics are an instrumental surf rock band from Milwaukee. America's only Zagat-Rated surf band, and nominated for both 2014 artist and album of the year by 88Nine Radio Milwaukee, The Revomatics have shared the stage with The B-52s, The Madeira, and the legendary Dick Dale. Come see why OnMilwaukee.com says, The Revomatics have "an insanely infectious sound that will hook you from the get-go". Please contact info@therevomatics.com for more information.

== Band Members ==

 * Drew De Lutio - Guitar
 * Joe Weigel - Guitar
 * Pete Flessas - Bass Guitar
 * Jeff Schneider - Drums

